      "content": "idk... the \"change\" thing feels so impossible. there's literally nothing left to change. everything is just quiet. it's like i'm a ghost haunting my own life. it would be so much easier if i just actually was one, you know? like i could just fade away for real and not have to deal with this weird half-life.",
